  "meta": {
    "description": "Long-only, fully invested equal-risk-contribution portfolio over nine asset-class ETFs (US, developed and emerging equity; intermediate, long and inflation-linked Treasuries; gold; commodities; US REITs). Each month-end, the covariance of the last 252 daily returns is estimated and weights are set so every asset contributes equally to portfolio variance. Assets join once they have 252 daily returns. Unlevered, no cash leg.",
    "references": [
      {
